      "problem": "Calculate the value of ${}_{11}P_2.$",
      "worked_solution": "The formula for ${}_nP_r$ is given by\n\n$$\n{}_nP_r  = \\dfrac {n!} {(n - r)!} \\,.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n={11}$ and $r=2$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\require{cancel}\n        \\eqalign{\n        \t\n        \t{}_{11}P_2  &= \\dfrac {11!} {(11 - 2)!} \\[5pt]\n                            &= \\dfrac {11!}{9!} \\[5pt]\n                            &= \\dfrac {11 \\cdot 10 \\cdot  \\cancel{9!}} {\\cancel{9!}} \\[5pt]\n                            &= 11 \\cdot 10 \\[5pt]\n                            &= 110.\n         }\n$$",
